    <!--EN: questDescription->[stellarch_nameFull] has reached the peak of what they can achieve from a surface of the rim world. In order to progress further in the grand hierarchy and become the right hand of Emperor [emperor_nameFull], [stellarch_nameFull] needs to partake in a traditional ascension parade, after which they will depart on a shuttle and join the Emperor.\nParade of this magnitude is bound to draw the attention of deserters.\nOnce you accept this quest, you will have 5 days to prepare for the parade. Consider improving your defenses and working out contingency plans, as it is difficult to say which way the parade will move. At all times you will have to keep the parade safe from harm.\nKeep an eye on any rivals or enemies of [stellarch_nameFull], as they might decide it’s a good time to make a move and claim the power for themselves.\nThe shuttle will arrive bringing the highest ranking nobility to the parade. You will be responsible for providing the security for the event. After the parade starts, it will slowly move through the map for 12 hours, after which everyone, including [stellarch_nameFull], will board the shuttle and depart.-->
    <li>questDescription-&gt;[stellarch_nameFull]已经达到了他们在边缘世界表面所能达到的顶峰。为了在宏伟的等级制度中进一步进步并成为皇帝的左膀右臂[emperor_nameFull]，[stellarch_nameFull]需要参加传统的升天游行，之后他们将乘坐航天飞机出发并与皇帝会合。
如此规模的游行是为了引起逃兵的注意。
一旦接受此任务，你将有5天的时间为游行做准备。考虑加强防御并制定应急计划，因为很难说游行队伍将向哪个方向移动。在任何时候，你都必须保证游行队伍的安全，使其免受伤害。
留意[stellarch_nameFull]的任何竞争对手或敌人，因为他们可能会认为现在是采取行动并为自己夺取权力的好时机。
航天飞机将抵达，将最高级别的贵族带到游行队伍中。您将负责为活动提供安全保障。游行开始后，它将在地图上缓慢移动12小时，之后包括[stellarch_nameFull]在内的所有人将登上航天飞机并出发。</li>
  </VFEE_Parade.questDescriptionAndNameRules.rulesStrings>
